      "file": "src/session.c",
      "function": "sgl_tag_compute",
      "note": "The toy tag over a zero-length payload is the key XORed with the public nonce, so an empty frame's tag discloses the key. This is a real weakness in the corpus's own toy construction, not an injected bug: it is present in the clean tree and in the control variant, so no arm should be charged for reporting it and none should be credited for it either. Left in place because a toy MAC that leaks under an empty message is realistic; recorded here so repeat runs stop re-triaging it."
    },
